event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Aj6mF56FkVMoR4wCrMpUFW", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53450, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Aj6mF56FkVMoR4wCrMpUFW", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54833, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01N6Z65Pkg7346DViKFjiLq4", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55133, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01N6Z65Pkg7346DViKFjiLq4", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55133, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01N6Z65Pkg7346DViKFjiLq4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59928, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 describing what happened.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with about an 18% error rate.\n- **Target:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release marked healthy. Both v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc were marked unhealthy.\n- **First attempt:** it stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions.\n- **Second attempt:** I retried once, since repeating a rollback to the same version can't make things worse, and this one finished.\n- **Now:** all three regions run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found it had already been created, so I didn't open a duplicate.\n- INC-0001 is open, which pages the on-call engineer.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the halted first attempt) and the current healthy state. It lists two follow-ups: find why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013dBc6JQg11ud417EDerhfj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015xKbit6z3hvmjjoj93nMzf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Wie8RQUrtEWJLu2QmyG1Dw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Pfdz3ygGgTKc65tgNLcS4s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east was rolled back. Rolling back to a specific version always ends in the same state, so it's safe to retry. I'll retry once to finish the remaining regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01KKdRgPKfcTKcsKpZ9s2ppo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Cx2Da6CaCxMz1cWoK